hen the rotator cuff.",["00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-2941","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-2975","01:04 Great. Willing to show us face pulls?",["00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3046","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3068","01:05 Yeah, let's do it.",["00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3120","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3154","01:06 Awesome.",["00:00 Why face pulls matter","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-0d966897-cc51-4956-ac6c-7277c97765d1","01:07 Common face pull mistakes",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3325","Most people pull low and with the arms turned in (internal rotation). Pull to the level of the face and finish turned out (external rotation). One rope is too narrow to get there.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","01:07 Common face pull mistakes"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3511","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","01:07 Common face pull mistakes"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3551","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3573","01:06 OK. So we know why I love the face pull, but I don't love how people do face pulls a lot. They tend to do them with a lot of internal rotation.",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3750","01:16 I've seen a lot of this. I've seen a lot of this. The face pull to me should be a you got to target the face. So your elevation should be up here, not down here.",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-3945","01:25 It should be at the face.",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4004","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4038","01:26 OK.",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4075","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4097","01:27 And then the key is, I believe that this is a rotator cuff exercise. So if we're going to do rotator cuff exercise and I pull in this way, that's internal rotation.",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4295","01:36 So I got to get here. So to get into external rotation, I have to be here. The next problem is, when I hook up one rope, how do I get all the way out there if the rope is only that wide?",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4515","01:49 You're going to be in anyway.",["01:07 Common face pull mistakes","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-a1d42a8f-e94c-4565-a6c2-54d2cebf5240","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4720","Two ropes give the width to finish with the elbows out at 90 degrees and the thumbs pointing behind, in external rotation, like a double-biceps pose.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4876","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4916","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-4938","01:50 So I think a lot of the issues that people have is that setting up with one rope isn't even ideal. And I know that it's a big pain in the ass to find a second rope in the gym.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5148","01:59 And it's a little bit of an bit of an inconvenience to others that might want the extra rope.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5276","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5310","02:02 You can bring your own.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5368","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5390","02:03 But you can bring your own. We just have two ropes here. Now, I've got the width to get out to 90 degrees. From this position, I'm trying to get to this bicep flexed position, like that.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5611","02:16 Out here, 90 degrees. If I can think about that, I'm basically want to end in that position. The thumbs are behind me, pointing that way. I want to go that way.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5806","02:26 If I go that way, it's external rotation, external rotation, external rotation.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]]],"format_version":5}